From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: knapcio <knapcio@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:53:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/26] S2: MTP confidence stop for solo MTP rounds behind
 G6_MTP_KSTOP, round log G6_MTP_LPLOG

A DFlash2 session's MTP rounds (drafter choice) chain and verify 1..G6_MTP_KSTOP_KMAX (<= 3) drafts chosen from the
MTP head's log-probabilities, which S2 now returns with the draft steps (Hooks::lp). Mode 1: draft j while
p_1 * .. * p_j >= G6_MTP_KSTOP_TAU t_j; mode 2: the drafter choice's MTP estimates (SpecLen choose/more). The
probabilities are the same bytes on every rank, so every rank takes the same k; the policy is in the runtime signature.
A demoted session's chain is completed to K before its first shared round. Off (default): the planner's steps are
unchanged. G6_MTP_LPLOG=1 logs each solo round's draft log-probabilities and accept count for offline tuning.
